WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.200
This song is from 1967.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.267
It was filmed in black and white.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.633
Here it is in colour, made by MakeItColor,

00:00:10.633 --> 00:00:12.933
right on my own PC.

00:00:13.967 --> 00:00:16.967
Drop in old photos or whole films.

00:00:16.967 --> 00:00:19.567
An AI model paints in natural colours,

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:22.567
and every detail of the original stays.

00:00:23.267 --> 00:00:25.200
It restores them too.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.500
Faded contrast comes back, and a small enhancer takes out blur,

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.100
noise and compression damage.

00:00:32.733 --> 00:00:34.467
Small photos can come out up

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:37.333
to four times larger, and sharper.

00:00:38.167 --> 00:00:39.900
Videos keep their sound,

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:43.233
and their colours stay steady from frame to frame.

00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:46.367
It uses your NPU first,

00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:49.400
then your graphics card, then your CPU.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.700
Nothing is uploaded,

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:53.333
and your originals are never changed.

00:00:53.867 --> 00:00:56.333
The colours are the model's best guess,

00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:58.267
not a record of the real ones.

00:00:58.267 --> 00:01:00.933
So you choose how strong they look.

00:01:01.767 --> 00:01:06.400
MakeItColor is free for Windows 10 and 11.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:09.467
Download it at nomanshafiq.com/makeitcolor
